        {
          "id": "editorial",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "MOVEMENT 01 OF 48 · §0/1 · #0 · ROOM 00-INTEGRAL-THRESHOLD",
          "title": "The Question Before the Mechanism",
          "italic": "Argued",
          "body": "Planetary systems can model and act while displacing the subject for whom distinctions matter. The essay therefore begins with the formal limit and asks whether an intelligence can make the horizon from which it acts available to reflection. The Antikythera mechanism enters only after the argument has derived what attunement requires of such an instrument.\nThe opening movement of the reading path.   ·   next → M02 Define the Subject Without Making It an Object",
